    "name": "Return to the Scabbard",
    "unlock_layer": 6,
    "passive_art": true,
    "rule": "After 3 s in which you fire no damaging art, the foe counts as unstruck again: your pieces that read your first hit on a foe, or your first sword art of the fight, re-arm, and any later-hit penalty they carry clears. Your first sword art on an unstruck foe cannot be evaded."
   }
